OL,3,GNEWSABereavement cafe set up for those
OL,4,Aneeding support
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new bereavement cafe for people
OL,7,Faffected by the loss of a loved one is
OL,8,Fto launch in Guildford this week.
OL,10,FLed by Royal Surrey Chaplain, Reverend
OL,11,FPhil Hughes, it is the result of a
OL,12,Fpartnership between Royal Surrey NHS
OL,13,FFoundation Trust and Phyllis Tuckwell
OL,14,FHospice Care.
OL,16,FThe initiative has been described by
OL,17,Fthe trust as "recognising that the need
OL,18,Ffor support doesn't end when someone
OL,19,Feventually dies, and that bringing
OL,20,Fpeople together can make a huge
OL,21,Fdifference to their mental health".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
