OL,3,GNEWSABereavement cafe set up for those
OL,4,Aneeding support
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This cafe is for patients' families
OL,7,Fand friends, as well as our staff and
OL,8,Fmembers of our broader community who
OL,9,Fmay have been affected by bereavement,"
OL,10,Fsaid Hughes.
